<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="4" style="">{!Lead.FirstName},</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="4" style=""><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4">40% of our clients at Memphis Invest live in California. Another 30% live in the Northeast corridor between NYC and Washington D.C.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4">The reasons for this are pretty obvious when you think about it.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4">Every time I speak to a new person who has visited our site and scheduled a 1-to-1 call with me, I ask them this:</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><span style="font-size: large;"><br></span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><span style="font-size: large;"><b><i>"Why are you looking to invest outside your own local market?"</i></b></span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><span style="font-size: large;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4">Typically, the response will come back in rapid fire from the investor on the other side of the call.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4">"Prices way too high... rents not high enough... state laws are a nightmare for landlords...property taxes too high... have to buy in a war zone just to get any kind of positive cash flow"... these are all the usual responses I receive back.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4">The folks on the other end of the phone are usually ambitious, successful folks with money that they want to allocate towards building a portfolio and they are committed to becoming serious real estate investors.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4">They just need a team that they can partner with to provide them with properties that make sense for investors, in markets that make sense in which to invest for the long term, and they all want that team to manage the assets they acquire for them. They want to be true investors, not landlords.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4">If this sounds like you, <a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bde1-baba97f6-16a5be04-baba97f6-00000007-1s19g530acl5j8g9e2faj934keo7bi8u&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1">then schedule a call with me right here</a> and let's talk it through and see if we are a good fit to help you overcome the obstacles holding you back from hitting your investing goals.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4">We have already helped almost 2000 other folks build portfolios over the last 15 years, managing over 5000 properties in some of the best investment markets in the country on their behalf.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4">So let's get moving. <a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bde1-baba97f6-16a5bdb5-baba97f6-00000007-1s19g530acl5j8g9e2faj934keo7bi8u&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1">Schedule the call</a> and let's see if this will work for you too.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4">Marq</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4">———————————————————————</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font color="#1155cc" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bde1-baba97f6-16a5be04-baba97f6-00000007-1s19g530acl5j8g9e2faj934keo7bi8u&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1"><img src="https://docs.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1nGEH5IZsXxv52rNbVJepefIlS1odDllU&amp;revid=0B6FqHnQBLWozakhvQ3dEdmVmSzd4aTl0TVU3cytoaEplYkZrPQ" width="420" height="287"></a></span></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
